&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yusuf&amp;nbsp; A. Hannun, MD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joel Strum Kenny Professor in Cancer Research&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SUNY Distinguished Professor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director, the Kavita and Lalit Bahl Center for Metabolomics and Imaging&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
